# Scoped to the suibench image build (BuildKit reads this in preference to a
# context-root .dockerignore). Patterns are relative to the build context, the
# repo root.
#
# pnpm regenerates node_modules inside the image via `pnpm install`, and the
# pruned deploy carries only what it needs — copying workspace node_modules would
# ship broken store symlinks and bloat the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo
.git
.claude
# Not part of the suibench grading images — keep it out of the context.
backend
